# P5.6 wave 3: the SAO chain (RenderSSAO: camera depth, its mips, the raw AO, the blurs) and the screen-space reflection pass (the
# mask downsample, the ray march, the compute blur) drawn by the graph, with the HDR effect and the VL / lens flare composite as
# before. Same tour as imagespace-sao-ssr-org0.env; the shots should match it (AO in corners and under eaves, reflections on the
# river). The log should show "[ORG] ImageSpace: on" listing the sao and ssr effects, "registered <n> passes", "the graph holds
# <n> passes", "the first batch", and no "[ORG] ImageSpace:" error. With CS_ORG_IMAGESPACE_LOG=1 each new shape is logged; each
# refused effect is named once ("<effect> stays on D3D11 (<reason>)"). Expected refusals: none for the SAO and reflection effects
# above in a steady frame. Bisect with CS_ORG_IMAGESPACE_EFFECTS=sao or =ssr in a copy of this file.
CS_ORG_ENGINE_CONSTANTS=1
CS_ORG_IMAGESPACE=1
CS_ORG_IMAGESPACE_LOG=1
DXVK_DEBUG=hang
VK_LOADER_LAYERS_DISABLE=*nsight*
CS_DCLF_TEST_COMMANDS=600:set timescale to 0;601:set gamehour to 13;602:fw 81a;700:coc Whiterun;2000:fw 81a;2400:dclf:shot=whiterun;2410:set gamehour to 23;2800:dclf:shot=whiterun-night;2810:set gamehour to 13;2900:coc WhiterunDragonsreach;4000:dclf:shot=dragonsreach;4100:coc Riverwood;5200:fw 81a;5500:dclf:shot=riverwood;5510:tfc;5520:dclf:shot=riverwood-tfc
CS_DCLF_TEST_EXIT=5600
